  "og_description": "Discover the Momcozy M5 Smart: the app-controlled upgrade to our best-selling M5. Get the same strong suction and integrated design, with smart tracking at the same great price!",
  "body_text": "Gentle, Breast-Friendly Pumping \n\n Baby mouth-like suction rhythm, skin-friendly silicone, and 30-minute auto stop help make daily pumping feel gentler and more comfortable. \n\n Patented DoubleFit™ Flange for a Better Fit \n\n The exclusive DoubleFit™ flange is made to fit more securely and comfortably, helping reduce slips and tugs while boosting pumping efficiency by 28.2% based on internal user feedback. \n\n Ultra-Light, Hands-Free Freedom \n\n Weighing only 8 oz, M5 Smart fits comfortably in your bra for cord-free, hands-free pumping—so you can move, work, care for baby, or get more done while you pump. \n\n Personalized Pumping with Flexible Suction \n\n With 3 pumping modes and 9 suction levels, M5 Smart lets you adjust each session to your body’s needs, supporting comfortable and efficient milk expression. \n\n Only 4 Parts to Clean \n\n Made with BPA-free, food-grade silicone and PP, M5 Smart keeps cleanup simple with only 4 washable parts. Parts can be sterilized in 3 minutes and are heat safe up to 212°F. \n\n Easier Control from Your Phone \n\n Use the Momcozy app to adjust modes and suction levels, track milk output, and view visual pumping stats by day, week, or month—giving you easier control without reaching into your bra.",
