  "body_text": "SLEEK, LOW-PROFILE WEAR FOR REAL LIFE \nWith an ultra-slim 61mm/2.4-inch body, Air 1 sits more naturally under clothing for a polished, less bulky look. It’s designed for moms who want pumping to feel more discreet and more wearable during workdays, commuting, travel, and social outings.\n\n WIRELESS CHARGING CASE, READY TO GO \nThe wireless charging case supports up to 15 pumping sessions, about 30 minutes each, helping keep Air 1 ready through busy days and everyday routines. Less time stopping to recharge, more continuity for moms who need pumping to fit into life—not interrupt it.\n\n TOP-VIEW VISIBILITY FOR FASTER ALIGNMENT \nThe transparent top-view design helps you align faster, while clear markings let you see milk output at a glance. When you’re pumping away from home or in the middle of a busy day, that extra visibility brings more confidence and fewer repeated adjustments.\n\n\n SMARTER PUMPING, STRONGER CONTROL \nAir 1 goes beyond basic app control with sensor-enabled features like auto mode switching, milk tracking, and full-collector alerts. You stay more informed throughout each session—without constantly checking, guessing, or interrupting your flow.\n\n\n GENEROUS 6oz CAPACITY IN A SLIM PROFILE \nThe 6oz collector gives you more room without adding bulk. Air 1 is built to balance low-profile wear with real-life pumping needs, making it a strong fit for daily use, longer outings, and other outside-home sessions.",
