  "标题": "Smart Non-WiFi Baby Monitor 5.5-Inch Full HD (BM03 Black)",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12",
  "og_description": "Want smart alerts without WiFi or phone distractions? Momcozy BM03S offers a 5.5-inch Full HD screen with cry, cough and motion notifications for local check-ins.",
  "body_text": "The Momcozy 5.5 Inch Full HD Smart Non-WiFi Baby Monitor is a video baby monitor designed for parents who want clear, private, and smarter baby viewing without relying on home WiFi. It includes a dedicated parent unit and a 1080P Full HD baby monitor camera, giving families a secure local connection for everyday nursery check-ins, naps, and overnight monitoring. \n \n\n BM03 Black combines a 5.5 inch Full HD screen, 1080P camera clarity, and a secure FHSS local connection with smart viewing features that make monitoring easier. Auto face focus helps keep your baby’s face easier to see on screen, while 360° pan, 140° tilt, and up to 4x zoom let you adjust the view as your baby moves. Smart sound, motion, cry, cough, and safe-zone notifications help parents notice meaningful changes without constantly watching the screen. Night view, two-way audio, and ENC noise reduction support clearer check-ins day and night. \n \n\n The monitor and camera are made with smooth, durable plastic housing, softly rounded edges, and a clean matte finish. The parent unit feels comfortable to hold, with tactile physical buttons for quick control and a large screen that is easy to read during late-night use. \n \n\n BM03 Black is ideal for parents who want a smart non-WiFi baby monitor, families who prefer a private local connection, and caregivers who need reliable room-to-room monitoring without opening an app. It supports multi-camera viewing and split-screen use, making it suitable for one nursery, siblings, or different rooms in the home. \n \n\n For care, wipe the monitor and camera with a soft, dry cloth. Keep the device away from water, avoid harsh cleaners, and place the camera on a stable surface with a clear view of the baby’s sleep area. Storage card is not included.",
